# API REST de diagnóstico (README: "API REST de diagnóstico").
# VS Code + extensión REST Client (humao.rest-client): "Send Request" sobre cada petición.
# Ejecutar primero "login": las demás usan su token.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@email = doctor@correo.cl
@password = secret123

### Emitir token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/tokens
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Evaluar parámetros (no guarda nada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnoses/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sex": "H",
  "age": 40,
  "physical_activity": 2,
  "anthropometry": { "weight_kg": 80, "height_cm": 165, "waist_cm": 98 },
  "vitals": { "systolic_bp": 128, "diastolic_bp": 82 },
  "labs": { "fasting_glucose": 105, "fasting_insulin": 18.2, "triglycerides": 180, "hdl": 38 },
  "conditions": { "hypertension": true }
}

### Evaluar solo con los parámetros obligatorios
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnoses/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sex": "M",
  "age": 30,
  "physical_activity": 1,
  "anthropometry": { "weight_kg": 55, "height_cm": 160 }
}

### Diagnóstico guardado (cambiar el id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnoses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Error 422: sexo, glicemia fuera de rango y diastólica mayor que sistólica
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnoses/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sex": "X",
  "age": 40,
  "physical_activity": 2,
  "anthropometry": { "weight_kg": 80, "height_cm": 165 },
  "vitals": { "systolic_bp": 80, "diastolic_bp": 90 },
  "labs": { "fasting_glucose": 2000 }
}

### Error 401: sin token
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnoses/evaluate
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Revocar el token (después, las peticiones con él dan 401)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
